WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:27.557
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:29.567
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:31.576
Harland把宣布提前了，还有十分钟。
Harland moved it up. Ten minutes.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
你：什么订婚？你刚才说我害的，什么意思？
You: What engagement? You said it was my doing. What do you mean?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:45.161
今晚，楼上。我本该宣布订婚。
Tonight. Upstairs. I'm supposed to announce it.

00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:52.697
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
你：Mate？你凭什么这么说？证明给我看。
You: Mate? What makes you say that? Prove it.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:02.765
你要证据？
You want proof?

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:08.794
收回獠牙，低声说：现在你知道了
Now you know.

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:12.813
低声说：跟我走
Come with me.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
你：自己坐进后排车里
You: Get into the back seat yourself
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:20.369
好。
Good.

00:01:22.579 --> 00:01:24.388
走吧。
Let's go.

00:01:26.598 --> 00:01:28.407
现在我身上全是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
你：暴露给谁？你到底在怕什么？
You: Exposed to whom? What are you really afraid of?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:37.973
我怕的不是我自己。是他们找到你。
Not afraid. Of them finding you.

00:01:41.522 --> 00:01:44.672
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:44.872 --> 00:01:48.021
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
你：伸手，轻轻握住他的手腕
You: Reach out and gently hold his wrist
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:55.577
别……留在这儿。
Don't. ...Stay.

00:01:58.289 --> 00:02:00.601
我不是人类，不像你。
I'm not human. Not like you.

00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:03.113
你打乱了我所有的计划，我却很高兴。
You broke everything I planned. I'm glad.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
你：我可以跟你进去，但刚才那个女人是谁？
You: I'll go in with you, but who was that woman?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:13.181
那是Selene。我本该娶她。
Selene. I was meant to marry her.

00:02:13.381 --> 00:02:15.693
这里，是我的家。
Here. This is my home.

00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:20.717
会好的。这里到处都是我的气味。
It'll settle. My scent is everywhere.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
你：你本该娶她。那现在，你会选她还是选我？
You: You were supposed to marry her. So now, her or me?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:30.785
只有你。
You. Only you.

00:02:34.334 --> 00:02:37.484
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就走了。
I walked out on it the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:37.684 --> 00:02:40.833
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
你：走近一步，抬头看他
You: Step closer and look up at him
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:48.389
你走近了。
You came closer.

00:02:48.589 --> 00:02:50.901
我不会让任何人伤你。
I won't let anyone hurt you.

00:02:53.613 --> 00:02:55.925
Arkwright小姐，他今晚不见客。
Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving tonight.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
你：让她进来。我倒要看看她到底想说什么。
You: Let her in. I want to hear what she has to say.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:05.993
他点头：随你。
As you wish.

00:03:06.193 --> 00:03:08.505
他低声：让她进来。
Let her in.

00:03:11.217 --> 00:03:13.529
Selene：一个人类，Magnus？满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
A human, Magnus? The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
你：走近他，手贴上他的脸
You: Step close and touch his face
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:23.597
他闭眼靠进她的掌心：“别停。”
Don't stop.

00:03:23.797 --> 00:03:26.946
他睁眼，低声问：“那是什么？”
Then what is it?

00:03:27.146 --> 00:03:30.296
切到起居室，他站在炉火前：“陪我坐。”
Sit with me.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
你：刚才Selene说长老会要带走我，是真的吗？
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:41.201
是真的。
It's true.

00:03:41.401 --> 00:03:43.211
他们带不走你。有我在。
They won't take you. Not while I breathe.

00:03:49.439 --> 00:03:51.249
留在我身边。
Stay with me.

00:03:51.549 --> 00:03:53.849
你：握住他的手，说我留下
You: Take his hand and say you'll stay
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 13 轮 · Realtime round 13）

00:03:53.949 --> 00:03:58.805
他低声让她再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:03:59.005 --> 00:04:01.317
他请她今晚留下。
Stay with me tonight.

00:04:09.153 --> 00:04:11.453
你：外面那是什么声音？是在叫你吗？
You: What's that sound outside? Is it calling you?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 14 轮 · Realtime round 14）

00:04:11.553 --> 00:04:16.409
那是族群在叫我。
That's my pack. Calling me.

00:04:16.609 --> 00:04:19.758
Alpha，Harland召集了长老，要你今晚交人。
Alpha. Harland called the elders. Tonight.

00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:23.108
那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:04:26.757 --> 00:04:29.057
你：他们要的是我，我当然要一起去。
You: It's me they want. Of course I'm going too.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 15 轮 · Realtime round 15）

00:04:29.157 --> 00:04:34.013
那就站在我身边。
Then stand beside me.

00:04:34.213 --> 00:04:36.023
来。
Come.

00:04:38.232 --> 00:04:40.042
画外：把她交出来，Magnus。族规比你古老。
Hand her over, Magnus. The law is older than you.

00:04:44.361 --> 00:04:46.661
你：走到他身边，直视长老
You: Walk to his side and face the elders
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 16 轮 · Realtime round 16）

00:04:46.761 --> 00:04:51.617
你站在我身边。
You stand with me.

00:04:51.817 --> 00:04:54.966
你向自己的血脉宣战了。
You have declared war on your own blood.

00:04:58.516 --> 00:05:01.665
那就如此。
So be it.

00:05:01.965 --> 00:05:04.265
你：你们要带走我？先问问我愿不愿意。
You: You want to take me? Ask me first.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 17 轮 · Realtime round 17）

00:05:04.365 --> 00:05:09.221
问她。他们本该先问。
Ask her. They should.

00:05:09.421 --> 00:05:12.570
她的答案才是唯一算数的。
Her answer is the only one that counts.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.920
满月决定一切。还剩三夜。
The full moon decides. Three nights.

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:21.869
你：握住他的手，走出会堂
You: Take his hand and walk out of the hall
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 18 轮 · Realtime round 18）

00:05:21.969 --> 00:05:26.825
他看着她握来的手，低声：一起。
Together.

00:05:27.025 --> 00:05:29.337
他点头：来。
Come.

00:05:34.561 --> 00:05:36.873
他目光坚定：Arkwright家的人在山下等着。
Arkwrights are waiting below.
